{"labs": [{"stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "id": 0, "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "_data": []}, {"type": "audio", "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"coverimg": "", "images": [{"text": "<strong> Interviewer: </strong> Good morning, Mr. Rose, I'm Francis Burton with Mystery Magazine. Thank you for speaking with me.&nbsp;<br /> <strong>Brian Rose: </strong> The pleasure is mine.", "id": 0, "image": "", "time": "0"}, {"text": "<strong> Interviewer: </strong> Mr. Rose, you are the owner of the Q Hotel, where some people see strange things. In the words of one past guest, \"It's a nice place to stay, even though there are ghosts!\" Could you tell us about that?", "id": 1, "image": "", "time": "8000"}, {"text": "<strong>Brian Rose: </strong> Yes. It's true that the hotel is haunted, although the ghosts are harmless. About 20 years ago, a mother and daughter died in a fire in room 609. We see the ghosts in that room, and sometimes around the hotel.<br /> <strong> Interviewer: </strong> Does anyone stay in room 609?", "id": 2, "image": "", "time": "23000"}, {"text": "<strong>Brian Rose: </strong> I keep the room closed, because I want people to have a peaceful stay. But the ghosts don't hurt anybody. People have seen the little girl playing, and sometimes they hear laughter. People come to my hotel so that they can try to see the ghosts.", "id": 3, "image": "", "time": "43000"}, {"text": "<strong> Interviewer: </strong> Well, I'm sure our readers will enjoy the story! Mr. Rose, thank you for your time. And stay safe!", "id": 4, "image": "", "time": "59000"}], "audiosrc": ""}}], "title": "", "template_override": 1, "id": 1, "_data": []}, {"type": "text", "contents": [{"type": "img", "value": "engenn5le01ob12re2img01.jpg"}], "title": "", "template_override": 1, "id": 2, "_data": []}, {"type": "text", "contents": [{"type": "img", "value": "engenn5le01ob12re3img01.jpg"}], "title": "", "template_override": 1, "id": 3, "_data": []}, {"type": "text", "content